==Trivia==
*Settanbo Domain's Japanese name, 切丹保, is not a real word. However, it can be read the same way as ''[[wikipedia:Kiritanpo|kiritanpo]]'', a Japanese delicacy consisting of skewered cylindrical half-smashed rice toasted over an open flame. Due to this, it is likely that Settanbo Domain's English name was misromanized intentionally (Settanbo is not an actual word) because otherwise it would have been no different from kiritanpo.
**Kiritanpo is common in [[wikipedia:Akita Prefecture|Akita Prefecture]] where the stage is located on the in-game map.

